cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Craftsman, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Craftsman"
version: "5.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
abstract: >-
  Craftsman is a zero-dependency quality gate and multi-agent review loop for
  AI coding agents. It freezes the final diff, plans risk-driven bug hunts with
  fresh-context hunters and verifiers, records outcomes in a Git-local
  evidence ledger, and enforces completion through platform hooks.
